<title>NORWAY: FORECAST - Chase sees Norway March CPI up 3.3 pct y/y.</title>
<headline>FORECAST - Chase sees Norway March CPI up 3.3 pct y/y.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chase Investment Bank Ltd said on Thursday it expected Norway's consumer price index in March to rise by 3.3 percent year-on-year and by 0.5 percent from February.</p>
<p>In a 1997 inflation outlook, the bank said weaker electricity prices would begin to start feeding through in March's figures, but the full impact would not appear until April.</p>
</text>
